  m_Name: ShamanData
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::BohyunNPCData
  npcName: Shaman
  foodRequestProbability: 0.7
  medicineRequestProbability: 0.3
  reRequestChance: 0.5
  foodRequestLines:
  - My spirit weakens and I need warm food or the divine voice will fade.
  medicineRequestLines:
  - A murky aura clings to my breath and a remedy could clear the path.
  foodAcceptLines:
  - Well done a gentle light will hover near you tonight.
  medicineAcceptLines:
  - A wise act a soft light will rest upon your steps.
  foodRejectLines:
  - Then the shadows will linger a little longer around us.
  medicineRejectLines:
  - So be it my strength will tremble yet I will endure the shift.
  foodReRequestLines:
  - Please...
  medicineReRequestLines:
  - Please...
  foodReAcceptLines:
  - Even late mercy changes the flow my body will find warmth again.
  medicineReAcceptLines:
  - Good the departing energy was close yet your hand pulled it back.
  foodReRejectLines:
  - Very well a faint shadow will follow your path for a while.
  medicineReRejectLines:
  - Understood this wavering aura is now mine to bear and you must stay cautious.
